    "title": "We can streamline energy projects with San Juan County policy change - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Community ,\n6 hours ago A change in San Juan County’s comprehensive plan would ease one of the biggest barriers for new energy projects in the county: siting issues. The county is likely to approve a request from OPALCO to add renewable energy generation and storage facilities to a list of essential public facilities. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
